{"seq":9,"slug":"medium-array-techniques","title":"Medium 数组技巧","docCount":10,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lc0075-sort-colors","title":"LeetCode 75 颜色分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0075-sort-colors","wordCount":997,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0011-container-with-most-water","title":"LeetCode 11 盛最多水的容器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0011-container-with-most-water","wordCount":867,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"lc0015-three-sum","title":"LeetCode 15 三数之和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0015-three-sum","wordCount":879,"readingTime":4},{"seq":4,"slug":"lc0031-next-permutation","title":"LeetCode 31 下一个排列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0031-next-permutation","wordCount":1018,"readingTime":5},{"seq":5,"slug":"lc0033-search-in-rotated-sorted-array","title":"LeetCode 33 搜索旋转排序数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0033-search-in-rotated-sorted-array","wordCount":847,"readingTime":4},{"seq":6,"slug":"lc0034-find-first-and-last-position","title":"LeetCode 34 在排序数组中查找元素的第一个和最后一个位置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0034-find-first-and-last-position","wordCount":787,"readingTime":4},{"seq":7,"slug":"lc0048-rotate-image","title":"LeetCode 48 旋转图像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0048-rotate-image","wordCount":759,"readingTime":4},{"seq":8,"slug":"lc0053-maximum-subarray","title":"LeetCode 53 最大子数组和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0053-maximum-subarray","wordCount":909,"readingTime":4},{"seq":9,"slug":"lc0054-spiral-matrix","title":"LeetCode 54 螺旋矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0054-spiral-matrix","wordCount":746,"readingTime":3},{"seq":10,"slug":"lc0056-merge-intervals","title":"LeetCode 56 合并区间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0056-merge-intervals","wordCount":860,"readingTime":4}],"introMarkdown":"# Medium 数组技巧 简介\n\n进入 Medium 难度，数组题不再只是简单的遍历和修改，而是要求你灵活运用多种经典技巧来降低时间复杂度或巧妙处理复杂条件。本章精选十道中等难度的数组题目，覆盖双指针、二分查找、区间处理和矩阵操作等核心模式，是面试中出现频率最高的题目群。\n\n本章内容概览如下。**Container With Most Water** 用首尾双指针贪心收缩来求最大面积，是双指针策略在优化问题中的经典应用。**3Sum** 在排序基础上用双指针将三数之和从暴力的立方复杂度降至平方，同时训练去重逻辑的处理。**Next Permutation** 要求在原地生成下一个排列，考察对排列规律的观察能力和从右向左扫描的逆向思维。\n\n**Search in Rotated Sorted Array** 在旋转有序数组中用二分查找定位目标，要求精确判断有序半区的归属条件。**Find First and Last Position** 在有序数组中用两次二分分别定位左右边界，训练二分查找模板的灵活变形。**Rotate Image** 要求原地旋转矩阵，通过转置加翻转的组合操作实现，锻炼矩阵变换的空间想象力。\n\n**Maximum Subarray** 是最经典的动态规划入门题，用 Kadane 算法在线性时间内求最大子数组和。**Spiral Matrix** 训练按螺旋顺序遍历矩阵的边界控制能力，考察循环条件的精确设定。**Merge Intervals** 对区间排序后逐一合并，是区间类问题的标准处理模板。**Sort Colors** 用荷兰国旗算法在一次遍历中完成三路划分，是双指针在分区问题中的精妙应用。\n\n建议从双指针题目入手建立模式感，然后练习二分查找的变体来提升对边界条件的敏感度，最后完成矩阵和区间类题目拓展解题视野。本章的十道题涵盖了 Medium 数组题的主要模式，熟练掌握后你将具备应对绝大多数中等难度数组问题的能力。\n"}